        "title": "Say I know how to do something",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use 会 before an action for a learned skill. Negate this with 不会. Being able to perform the skill does not mean circumstances allow it right now.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我会说中文。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ huì shuō Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "I can speak Chinese.",
